<title>POLAND: Polish wheat/rye flat, barley price up last week.</title>
<headline>Polish wheat/rye flat, barley price up last week.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wheat and rye prices held flat, while barley prices rose during last week's grain auctions, Poland's Agriculture Ministry said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>POLISH FARM AUCTION PRICES (AVERAGE)</p>
<p>  Product   week to Oct 12    previous week    yr/yr change</p>
<p>   Wheat	65.01 zl/q	 64.99 zl/q	  71.1 pct</p>
<p>   Rye	  43.57 zl/q	 43.56 zl/q	  69.2 pct</p>
<p>   Barley     55.51 zl/q	 54.53 zl/q	  64.7 pct</p>
<p>NOTE: zl/q = zlotys per quintal.</p>
<p>--Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
